module barista
kind library

# barista is pure Beans and imports `std.reflect` and nothing else. No `csrc`
# row, no `link` row, no `require` row — and that is the property to keep.
#
# It has no I/O at all, deliberately. latte's core is built for
# wasm32-unknown-unknown to hold the line that it imports no std.fs, std.net or
# std.io (see latte/beans.pot and `latte/test.sh --wasm`); a container that
# latte's core depends on inherits that constraint, and `test.sh --wasm` here
# holds it independently so the failure lands in this repo rather than in a
# consumer's.
